            {
                "entry_id": "3dd15ee0-dd8b-345c-8795-f1cd7cabe9fc",
                "word": "Wischiwaschi",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "de",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5c25fd9d-c88d-4244-8cde-e03e2cb70733",
                        "entry_id": "3dd15ee0-dd8b-345c-8795-f1cd7cabe9fc",
                        "tags": [
                            "nominative",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "das Wischiwaschi"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a53d2f65-6309-4730-b21c-e3aceaa768cf",
                        "entry_id": "3dd15ee0-dd8b-345c-8795-f1cd7cabe9fc",
                        "tags": [
                            "genitive",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "des Wischiwaschis"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "68b9fbd0-ef46-4b5b-ab2a-f1a8c71dad09",
                        "entry_id": "3dd15ee0-dd8b-345c-8795-f1cd7cabe9fc",
                        "tags": [
                            "dative",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "dem Wischiwaschi"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c5667eba-fb5a-4225-80ce-84db8d1dbbd8",
                        "entry_id": "3dd15ee0-dd8b-345c-8795-f1cd7cabe9fc",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "das Wischiwaschi"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4400f4b7-679b-35a7-a911-0b5c3b0a0aae",
                        "entry_id": "3dd15ee0-dd8b-345c-8795-f1cd7cabe9fc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "unklares, wirres Gerede"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7ec8982-9a29-4b2f-ab39-f47c6165d65f",
                                "sense_id": "4400f4b7-679b-35a7-a911-0b5c3b0a0aae",
                                "text": "Was er von sich gibt, ist doch nur ein Wischiwaschi."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3b82c0e-2744-4707-8e55-0e70ec47a18f",
                                "sense_id": "4400f4b7-679b-35a7-a911-0b5c3b0a0aae",
                                "text": "„Wer sich in der Politik nur Wischiwaschi ausdrückt, wird bei den nächsten Wahlen abgestraft.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f1e891a-7e7b-40f9-9522-f5a3c1da91cc",
                                "sense_id": "4400f4b7-679b-35a7-a911-0b5c3b0a0aae",
                                "text": "„Er rechnete dabei ganz richtig auf die Urtheilslosigkeit und Niaiserie des Publikums, welches schlechte Sophismen, bloßen Hokuspokus und unsinniges Wischiwaschi für Beweise hinnahm …“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fae55199-deed-47d8-9aac-ddafb908fdfc",
                                "sense_id": "4400f4b7-679b-35a7-a911-0b5c3b0a0aae",
                                "text": "„Papa drückte sich wieder vorm Abendmahl, weil er mit dem ganzen Brimborium nichts am Hut haben wollte, und Mama sagte, die Predigt sei ja man ein ziemliches Wischiwaschi gewesen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9dbca10-1814-43fa-baa9-a16ef5b6fe25",
                                "sense_id": "4400f4b7-679b-35a7-a911-0b5c3b0a0aae",
                                "text": "„Die Deutsche Bahn als Bauherr habe - ebenso wie das Eisenbahnbundesamt als Genehmigungsbehörde - jedoch keine verbindlichen Zusagen geliefert, sondern lediglich \"Wischiwaschi\", sagte Welser am Montag der \"Süddeutschen Zeitung\".“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "faea7f0c-1f84-4af3-bbd6-fc20256039e5",
                        "source_entry_id": "3dd15ee0-dd8b-345c-8795-f1cd7cabe9fc",
                        "source_sense_id": "4400f4b7-679b-35a7-a911-0b5c3b0a0aae",
                        "source_sense_description": "umgangssprachlich, abwertend: unklares, wirres Gerede",
                        "target_lang_word": "wishy-washy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wishy-washy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "731a8e3f-b421-39d5-b708-30b1406ceeb9",
                                        "entry_id": "855e3610-e59c-345f-80df-12fd172923c7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wavering; lacking in commitment, certainty, support, and (often) clarity; namby-pamby."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73fc295d-2deb-4036-877c-a2c4a77b5cb1",
                                                "sense_id": "731a8e3f-b421-39d5-b708-30b1406ceeb9",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: vacillating, vacillatory"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c788146-f793-4895-a2b1-7a95109e5a6f",
                                                "sense_id": "731a8e3f-b421-39d5-b708-30b1406ceeb9",
                                                "text": "Not wanting to be pressed for details, public relations gave a wishy-washy answer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a949ae46-5e42-498a-805a-d4036824dc03",
                                                "sense_id": "731a8e3f-b421-39d5-b708-30b1406ceeb9",
                                                "text": "I’m not about to vote Conservative myself (I’m a wishy-washy centrist who liked Tony Blair’s early work and has since mostly voted Labour, with an occasional swing to the Liberal Democrats and Greens)[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68fa2294-dfa8-3a06-be77-e980643a55d8",
                                        "entry_id": "855e3610-e59c-345f-80df-12fd172923c7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Thin or watery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60af124f-c190-479b-b07e-72e8153a6400",
                                                "sense_id": "68fa2294-dfa8-3a06-be77-e980643a55d8",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: watered-down, diluted, dilute"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ffd1c7d-0f96-4a47-9b3e-8ff3d6b0ff58",
                                                "sense_id": "68fa2294-dfa8-3a06-be77-e980643a55d8",
                                                "text": "The wishy-washy orange juice served by the cafeteria not only failed to be sweet; it was barely orange."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2bac8c6-a439-4cd2-bdbc-2e397cac8da8",
                                                "sense_id": "68fa2294-dfa8-3a06-be77-e980643a55d8",
                                                "text": "Usually the quality of the liquor is judged by the \"bite\" of it. The hotter the better. A drink of first class, aged whisky would be ridiculed in most parts of Maine as a wishy-washy beverage fit only for mollycoddles. The Down East \"soak\" wants something that stings and burns all the way, and usually he gets it[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78f1297b-659f-4b5a-a9f0-e2f92da5a55d",
                                                "sense_id": "68fa2294-dfa8-3a06-be77-e980643a55d8",
                                                "text": "And you will appreciate drinking the hot cup, or rather billy, of tea—which is more than one can call the wishy-washy concoction served up in some 'tea-houses'."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4645709b-578b-428d-b700-2af3a3b98733",
                        "source_entry_id": "3dd15ee0-dd8b-345c-8795-f1cd7cabe9fc",
